Vendored third-party code
=========================

`eval_tae.py` is an UNMODIFIED copy of Video Depth Anything's temporal alignment error (TAE) evaluation script, vendored
so DN-01's temporal metric follows the exact upstream definition (Auditor K38(c)).

Source:   Video Depth Anything (Chen et al., CVPR 2025) -- https://github.com/DepthAnything/Video-Depth-Anything
Repo:     local clone at 4f5ae23172ba60fd7bc11ef671cca678842c7072 (HEAD)
