          2025-03-11), unmodified in the clone; sha256 8e481e94a4709c5ae945c81d8343170a38c253b6b7dac2a926d5bafc7de9606c
License:  Apache-2.0 (LICENSE, copied verbatim from the repo root)
Use:      evaluation/temporal_metrics.py calls `tae_torch` (and reproduces `eval_TAE`'s alignment in memory);
          tests/test_temporal_metrics.py checks our in-memory scorer equals `eval_TAE` on identical inputs.
